Description: entries of the 2003 #demoscene 4k source compo
 The four entries of the first #demoscene 4k source compo (March 2003),
 where the 4 KB limit applied to the C source code instead of the
 executable:
  - 3d by Jylam (winner), command 4ksrc-pack1-3d;
  - Lollipop hogwagen by tonic, command 4ksrc-pack1-hogwagen;
  - different wavelengths in the visible spectrum by spectre/flare,
    command 4ksrc-pack1-dwitvs;
  - oh the nos! its termos and styx' code! by termos and styx,
    command 4ksrc-pack1-randomname.
 .
 The first three use SDL, the last one OpenGL and GLUT.
